{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "号码被转走",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 121.94,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看账号这条路，SIM 卡劫持。",
   "spoken": "先看账号这条路，SIM 卡劫持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 1.69,
   "speechEnd": 4.426
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "攻击者让运营商，把受害者的手机号，转到自己的 SIM 卡上。",
   "spoken": "攻击者让运营商，把受害者的手机号，转到自己的 SIM 卡上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 4.86,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 4.954,
   "speechEnd": 10.289
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "常见的手法，是出示伪造证件，或者贿赂、欺骗客服。",
   "spoken": "常见的手法，是出示伪造证件，或者贿赂、欺骗客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 10.68,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 10.68,
   "speechEnd": 15.301
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "号码到手，他在交易所、邮箱、社交账号上，点忘记密码。",
   "spoken": "号码到手，他在交易所、邮箱、社交账号上，点忘记密码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 15.78,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 15.78,
   "speechEnd": 21.789
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "短信验证码，发到了他的新卡上。",
   "spoken": "短信验证码，发到了他的新卡上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 22.24,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 22.345,
   "speechEnd": 24.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "这一步能成功，是因为账号允许短信验证码，作为唯一的恢复方式。",
   "spoken": "这一步能成功，是因为账号允许短信验证码，作为唯一的恢复方式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 25.26,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 25.361,
   "speechEnd": 30.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "再想一种情况，账号开了验证器 App，但忘记密码时，仍然可以用短信。",
   "spoken": "再想一种情况，账号开了验证器 App，但忘记密码时，仍然可以用短信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 30.92,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 30.92,
   "speechEnd": 36.423
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "只要短信能单独完成恢复，验证器就被绕过了。",
   "spoken": "只要短信能单独完成恢复，验证器就被绕过了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 36.82,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 36.92,
   "speechEnd": 40.645
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "第二因素有多强，取决于恢复流程里最弱的一环。",
   "spoken": "第二因素有多强，取决于恢复流程里最弱的一环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 41.04,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 41.135,
   "speechEnd": 45.205
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "社交账号被劫持，入口不止换卡。",
   "spoken": "社交账号被劫持，入口不止换卡。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 45.58,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 45.58,
   "speechEnd": 48.865
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "还有弱密码被暴力破解，团队交接时，多因素认证被关掉。",
   "spoken": "还有弱密码被暴力破解，团队交接时，多因素认证被关掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 49.32,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 49.41,
   "speechEnd": 54.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "冒充平台官方，发版权侵权、账号违规的钓鱼邮件。",
   "spoken": "冒充平台官方，发版权侵权、账号违规的钓鱼邮件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 54.82,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 54.911,
   "speechEnd": 59.356
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "官方账号发出的链接，粉丝几乎没有理由怀疑。",
   "spoken": "官方账号发出的链接，粉丝几乎没有理由怀疑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 59.76,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 59.76,
   "speechEnd": 63.73
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "2023 年 9 月，Vitalik Buterin 的 X 账号被盗，发出了假的纪念 NFT 链接。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 9 月，Vitalik Buterin 的 X 账号被盗，发出了假的纪念 NFT 链接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 64.14,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 64.246,
   "speechEnd": 70.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "粉丝签名后，钱包被清空，ZachXBT 统计，约 69.1 万美元。",
   "spoken": "粉丝签名后，钱包被清空，ZachXBT 统计，约 69.1 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 70.92,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 70.92,
   "speechEnd": 77.196
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2024 年 1 月，安全公司 Mandiant 的 X 账号，被改名冒充 Phantom 钱包。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 1 月，安全公司 Mandiant 的 X 账号，被改名冒充 Phantom 钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 77.62,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 77.62,
   "speechEnd": 82.863
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "Mandiant 自查认为，很可能是被暴力破解，交接期间，多因素认证没有起到保护。",
   "spoken": "Mandiant 自查认为，很可能是被暴力破解，交接期间，多因素认证没有起到保护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 83.28,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 83.371,
   "speechEnd": 89.678
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "后来，有人冒充 X 官方，发版权侵权通知。",
   "spoken": "后来，有人冒充 X 官方，发版权侵权通知。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 90.14,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 90.14,
   "speechEnd": 93.871
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "接管了 15 个加密类账号，推广假代币，约 50 万美元。",
   "spoken": "接管了 15 个加密类账号，推广假代币，约 50 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 94.28,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 94.28,
   "speechEnd": 99.327
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "交易所的员工也一样。",
   "spoken": "交易所的员工也一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 99.7,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 99.793,
   "speechEnd": 101.209
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "美国联邦起诉书称，一个团伙对一名员工，做了 SIM 卡劫持。",
   "spoken": "美国联邦起诉书称，一个团伙对一名员工，做了 SIM 卡劫持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 101.68,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 101.782,
   "speechEnd": 106.675
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "转走的加密资产，超过 4 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "转走的加密资产，超过 4 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-21.wav",
   "start": 107.1,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 107.196,
   "speechEnd": 110.441
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "媒体援引消息源，确认受害公司是 FTX，时间是它申请破产的当天。",
   "spoken": "媒体援引消息源，确认受害公司是 FTX，时间是它申请破产的当天。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-22.wav",
   "start": 110.84,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 110.937,
   "speechEnd": 117.03
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "员工的手机号，就是交易所的特权凭证。",
   "spoken": "员工的手机号，就是交易所的特权凭证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-23.wav",
